Title: "ICD-O-3 Topography (primary site)"
Description: "Codes from the International Classification of Diseases for Oncology, 3rd edition (ICD-O-3), used to describe the primary site of a tumour. The code system is maintained by WHO and its concepts are not enumerated here."
